# Phase 2 — Tool Registry, Data Query Tool, EDA Tool

## Summary
Implemented the first three Phase 2 deliverables: Tool Registry, DataQueryTool, and EDATool.
All tools are standalone deterministic functions (no LLM). Each tool accepts typed Pydantic input,
returns typed ToolResult, and is dispatched through the registry with automatic timing and audit logging.

